  m_text: "Operator: Rainier\r\nContractor: DEF (Dependable Engineering and Fortification)\r\nA
    man of few words and many secrets, Rainier is DEF Corporation\u2019s newest addition
    to the Mountain Corps. Even amongst that elite force of defense specialists Rainier
    stands out for his resilience to pain, massive physical strength, and strict
    obedience to orders. As DEF tries to stake a claim for itself in the Pacific,
    Rainier will ensure there will be no trespassers. \r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
