    started her career as a combat medic in Europe during the Balkan Crisis. When
    the European United Armed Forces cut the pay of their veterans, she decided to
    go private and join SPT\u2019s Color Guard mercenary force. Her specialty is
    battlefield medicine, and survivability ensuring her own health and those of
    the SPT\u2019s transport lanes in the Pacific remain high.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
