  m_text: "Operator: Michigan\r\nContractor: DPS (Deep Pacific Salvage)\r\nA veteran
    of the Venezuelan War, but discharged from service due to psychological reasons.
    Michigan was picked up by DPS to join the Statesmen Squad for his combat ability
    and ruthlessness. He specializes in heavy weapons usage and overwhelming firepower,
    making sure there is no one left alive to threaten DPS\u2019 profits. \r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
